meta {
  name: Export Ledger CSV
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exports/ledger.csv
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The whole posted ledger, one row per posting, streamed as CSV. Takes no scope
  parameters by design: a flat file cannot carry the manifest that makes a
  scoped export reproducible, so adding from/to/account_id/commodity_id returns
  EXPORT_SCOPE_UNSUPPORTED rather than a quietly whole-ledger file. See
  docs/adrs/0011-ledger-export-contract.md.
}
